00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,700
Want better AI photos? Try these ten keywords in your next ChatGPT image prompt.

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:09,500
Product shot: give your subject a clean, commercial presentation.

3
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:14,500
Soft light: ask for gentle shadows and smooth transitions.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,300
Hard light: create crisp shadows and a bolder look.

5
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:24,500
Rim light: separate your subject with an illuminated edge.

6
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:29,100
Golden hour: bring in warm, low evening light.

7
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:34,500
Macro: move closer to reveal texture and tiny details.

8
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:39,100
Low angle: make the subject feel more imposing.

9
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:44,500
Minimal: remove distractions and give the subject room.

10
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:49,300
Editorial: try a styled, magazine-inspired composition.

11
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:54,800
Motion blur: suggest speed. Specify what should stay sharp.

12
00:00:55,300 --> 00:01:01,800
Add these to a clear description of your scene. Save this before your next generation.
